some of you  did not expect me to say this well  Daniel why do I need to be kind to be  successful in life well let me explain  let me explain it this way I actually  don't really care much about what  someone has achieved in their life what  success they achieved  but show me what they do with that  success show me how they treat other  people  and that will tell me exactly what kind  of person they are  Danny Thomas said success in life has  nothing to do with what you gain in Life  or accomplish for yourself  it's what you do for others  success without kindness without caring  about other people is not success  it is a waste of time  always ask yourself  what will people say about you when you  die  use time effectively all of us we get  the same time 24 hours each day seven  days a week what do you do with that  time now that that's on you you can  waste it on things that do not improve  you your future or the lives of other  people or you can use it to do exactly  that  first always be on time never be late  for appointments  this is one of those kind of things that  you need to learn as a young man as a  young boy you know always be on time  it's exactly the same as always make  your bed because if you don't make your  bed you're a lazy person you don't have  self-discipline so when it comes to time  be on time I love Japanese people  because they are always on time and it  shows professionalism  time is precious time is life and if  your time runs out so does your life  think about this if you're running late  you think why I'm just running late 10  minutes 15 minutes there's no big  problem but you're actually stealing 20  minutes from someone else's life  because you cause them to wait for you  for 20 minutes  second schedule your priorities do that  every day focus on it to do those things  that will get you closer to your goals  and when you achieve a goal each goal is  slowly getting you closer to your dream  it needs to become a daily routine so  that it will change your habits and that  means if it is a routine then you'll be  able to be consistent  be prepared if you don't plan ahead  you're planning to fail  a lot of people are very optimistic and  they are very positive when they start  something  but being optimistic and being positive  will not get you anywhere if you don't  plan and please hear me today a lot of  people experience problems  just because they were not prepared  people spend a lot of time and effort to  try and fix their problems in this world  but many do not realize that they can  prevent most of the problems they  experience if they are just prepared  you know there's a lot of people in  school and they say man I'm not going to  use this one day in life or this is what  I need to learn here from school I'm not  gonna use this it might be true but what  school does teach you is that you need  to work hard and not be lazy do things  that you sometimes do not like because  that is what it needs to be successful  sometimes you need to do things even  when you don't feel like at end  you always need to do research and  educate yourself and that is what school  is great at school teaches you how to  teach yourself and you need to get into  the habit of doing research not being  lazy but to learn because in life you  always need to do research to know your  options before you make a decision and  always have a backup plan for a backup  plan  adapt you know even if you do everything  that I've already talked about perfectly  you still need to adapt because man  there's life this life will throw you  not just one or two but a few curveballs  you need to expect the unexpected  because unexpected things that you  cannot control will happen your Wi-Fi  will go down in South Africa you can  expect power failure due to Cable theft  your car can break down or they might  steal your car your roof might be  leaking suddenly or your friend might  let you down or even worse someone close  to you might die all of the things that  I've just mentioned happen to me  you need to expect the unexpected and  when it does happen you need to adapt  and the faster you do it the better it  will be because the longer you sit and  complain about it  the longer you'll stay in it and sitting  in it wishing it was different is not  going to change reality  but you can you can do something about  it John Wooden said if we fail to adapt  we fail to move forward you only have  two options when you encounter obstacles  you can either just give up or you can  adapt and move on  never give up because you will fail many  times in this life over and over and  over again  but that is what is needed to change you  to make you stronger and then when you  do achieve success it'll be so much more  sweeter you'll appreciate it so much  more  see as Lewis said failures and repeated  failures are finger posts on the road to  achievement one fails forward towards  success  and before you do anything at all make  sure that you have the right dreams the  right goals in the first place because  if you don't you'll waste a lot of time  I prayed a long time before God pointed  me to the right direction in my middle  20s that's the first time that God  really spoke to me I prayed and prayed  and prayed breakthrough prayer until he  answered me three different ways if you  want to know more about my life  then watch this video here my testimony  from my other channel and I'll see you  there  and always remember life is short so  don't waste yours cheers guys


